---
// WhyChooseUs.astro — Benefits of partnering with Web Cunts Agency
---

<section id="why-choose-us" class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 border-b-2 border-[#111111] bg-[#F9F9F7]">
  <!-- Section Header -->
  <div class="mb-12 border-b-2 border-[#111111] pb-4">
    <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-600 font-bold mb-2">Benefits // Why Choose Web Cunts Agency</div>
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase text-[#111111] tracking-tight">WHY PARTNER WITH US</h2>
  </div>

  <!-- Column Grid: 4-cols with Borders -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 border border-[#111111] bg-white">
    <!-- Pillar 1 -->
    <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-r border-[#111111] hover:bg-[#F9F9F7] transition-colors duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-serif text-5xl font-black text-[#CC0000] leading-none mb-4">01</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold uppercase text-[#111111] mb-4 leading-tight">
          Custom-Crafted Code <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">(No Page Builders)</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
          We don’t use generic WordPress templates or bloated page builders like Elementor. Every line of code is hand-crafted using modern frameworks like Astro, React, and Tailwind CSS. This guarantees your site is unique, secure, and easily scalable.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 2 -->
    <div class="p-8 border-b lg:border-r border-[#111111] md:border-r-0 lg:border-b-0 hover:bg-[#F9F9F7] transition-colors duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-serif text-5xl font-black text-[#CC0000] leading-none mb-4">02</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold uppercase text-[#111111] mb-4 leading-tight">
          Sub-Second Speed <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">& Built-In SEO</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
          A slow website is a lost customer. Our sites are engineered to load in under 0.6 seconds and score a perfect 100/100 on Google Lighthouse benchmarks. We build with a mobile-first approach and bake technical SEO into the core architecture from day one.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 3 -->
    <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-[#111111] hover:bg-[#F9F9F7] transition-colors duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-serif text-5xl font-black text-[#CC0000] leading-none mb-4">03</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold uppercase text-[#111111] mb-4 leading-tight">
          Direct Access <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">to Senior Talent</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
          Skip the middleman. You won’t be passed off to account managers or junior interns. You will collaborate directly with the senior developers building your product, resulting in faster feedback loops and zero miscommunication.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 4 -->
    <div class="p-8 hover:bg-[#F9F9F7] transition-colors duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-serif text-5xl font-black text-[#CC0000] leading-none mb-4">04</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold uppercase text-[#111111] mb-4 leading-tight">
          Transparent <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">Fixed-Price Quotes</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
          No hidden fees, no hourly rate surprises. We analyze your requirements upfront and provide a fixed-price quote with clear deliverables. Once we launch, you own 100% of the source code—no vendor lock-in, ever.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
